    given-names: Silvester
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-16
license: Apache-2.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22797194
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22797194
    description: Concept DOI for all versions, archived on Zenodo
repository-code: "https://github.com/Silvester969/JawAtlas"
url: "https://silvester969.github.io/JawAtlas/"
abstract: >-
  JawAtlas is a free, fully offline iOS and iPadOS application that turns a
  dental cone beam CT scan into an interactive study companion, with
  tri-planar MPR following radiological conventions, a user-traced panoramic
  reconstruction, Metal ray-marched volume rendering, and an augmented
  reality slice-through mode. It is an education and training aid, not a
  medical device.
keywords:
  - CBCT
  - dental education
  - radiology
  - DICOM
  - medical imaging
  - augmented reality
  - iOS
  - Metal
